{/* The "media frame" from DESIGN.md: a hairline ring plus a layered shadow, so
    a video or screenshot reads as an object sitting on the page. The inner box
    holds the 16:9 slot and a subtle fill for the moment before the media
    paints. Shadows over borders, and the ring stays pure black/white. */}
<div
  class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden ring-1 ring-black/[0.08] dark:ring-white/10 shadow-[0_2px_4px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0_16px_32px_-8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.12)]"
>
  <div class="relative aspect-video bg-background-subtle">
    <slot />
  </div>
</div>
